title: "topocorr: terrain illumination correction and illumination-artefact tests for Landsat time series in Google Earth Engine"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-13"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24195254
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24195254
    description: "Concept DOI: all versions"
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24195255
    description: "Version 0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  topocorr computes the local solar illumination of every Landsat 5-9 Collection 2 Level 2 and
  Sentinel-2 L2A acquisition in Google Earth Engine from a DEM and the image's sun angles, flags
  shadowed and steep pixels, applies the standard terrain corrections (cosine, C, SCS+C) and tests
  whether trends and breaks in vegetation time series are illumination artefacts.
